      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it feels kinda dramatic to go all the way back to the ER for just some soreness and a tiny fever... my surgeon said it would be uncomfortable for a while. do u think it's possible it's just inflammation from the incisions? i'd rather just take some more ibuprofen and wait it out if i can skip the hospital for now.",
