      "content": "i hear you but i'm just really anxious about the hospital bill and being back in that environment. if i take an extra dose of ibuprofen and maybe some tylenol to bring the fever down, do you think that's a safe way to manage it for tonight? i'm pretty sure i can just sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning. it's probably just my body working hard to heal, right?",
